  "id": "modulation",
  "term": "modulation",
  "definition": "Modulation is the adjustment or shaping of effort or bodily regulation rather than simply holding the same outward form. In this context, it refers to changing how effort is organized, which may alter autonomic regulation even when the posture looks the same.",
